#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:7 ff2a36a2e8fa41f6bbcf8e29fa2711f7
msgid ""
"The linked articles below explain how to setup your build environment on "
"Linux/Ubuntu, MacOS or Windows and then build ArduPilot with `waf "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"下方链接的文章介绍了如何在 Linux/Ubuntu、MacOS 或 Windows 上配置构建环境，然后使用 `waf "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 构建 "
"ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:9 e9b701de9a384816851d12146882e489
msgid ""
"it is possible to use the `Custom code build server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to generate code with selectable feature "
"sets without creating a code development environment, but code change "
"proposals will require it."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 `自定义代码构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"生成带有可选功能集的代码，无需搭建代码开发环境，但提交代码变更提案则需要开发环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:11 a62e804e286c4050988f218e9e4a49d0
msgid ""
"The instructions below assume that you have already :ref:`installed git "
"<git-install>`, :ref:`forked <git-fork>` and :ref:`cloned <git-clone>` the "
"ArduPilot repo."
msgstr ""
"以下说明假设您已经 :ref:`安装了 git <git-install>`、:ref:`Fork <git-fork>` 并 :ref:`克隆 "
"<git-clone>` 了 ArduPilot 仓库。"

