#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:25 cfb4932085e146e1a41697a33d9380ff
msgid ""
"Linux and MacOSX users should build with waf as described in `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"Linux 和 MacOSX 用户应按照 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 中的说明使用 waf "
"构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:29 eab8287e63e74dc4b8b3ec9c56937dec
msgid "Do not use `sudo` unless specified in the instructions."
msgstr "除非说明中明确指定，否则不要使用 `sudo`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:33 6f1a1052d70145eeb0bc6ba1d27b9126
msgid "**Windows users:**"
msgstr "**Windows 用户：**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code.rst:35 8092bf86cba2481084624615602c572a
msgid ""
"Windows users should follow the WSL setup directions for Windows 10 "
"described in  :ref:`building-setup-windows10_new` or :ref:`building-setup-"
"windows11` for Windows 11 systems . This creates a Linux-like environment "
"called WSL/WSL2 from which the user can setup the build environment as "
"explained in :ref:`Setup the Build Environment on Linux/Ubuntu <building-"
"setup-linux>` and then use the instructions in `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"Windows 用户应按照 :ref:`building-setup-windows10_new` 中的 Windows 10 WSL 配置说明，或 "
"Windows 11 系统的 :ref:`building-setup-windows11` 说明操作。这将创建一个类 Linux "
"环境（WSL/WSL2），用户可在其中按照 :ref:`在 Linux/Ubuntu 上配置构建环境 <building-setup-linux>` "
"进行设置，然后使用 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 中的说明构建。"

